# player.px - Starfall Reload player interceptor, bank strip
# canvas 24x28 per frame, 5 frames: hard_left, left, level, right, hard_right (engine picks by bank)
# view: straight top-down, ship faces up. light: top-left (right half one ramp step darker; fuselage
# casts a 1 px shadow on the right wing root)
# outline: K exterior; interior lines only at canard root seam and nacelle intakes
# palette: steel ramp 1-6, cyan ramp c C b w (canopy + wingtip identity), shared dark K
# smallest must-read feature: cyan canopy 2x4 and wingtip accents 2x2
# anchor: frame centre (12,14). nacelle nozzles: x6-7 and x16-17, bottom row y=27 (flame centres at
# x=7.0 and x=17.0 in pixel-edge coordinates, i.e. -5/+5 px from centre, top at y=28 = +14)
# bank: the lowered wing foreshortens (mild: outboard panel 5->3 px, hard: 5->2 px) and darkens one step;
# hard bank also shortens the lowered canard, brightens the raised wing and rolls canopy/spine 1 px
# towards the lowered side. Fuselage, nacelles, nose and tail stay fixed in all frames.
palette
. transparent
1 #1c2238  steel-0
2 #2f3a5a  steel-1
3 #4a5a82  steel-2
4 #7184ad  steel-3
5 #a7b8d8  steel-4
6 #e4ecfa  steel-5
C #1d86b8  cyan-1
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
b #46c8ee  cyan-2
c #0d4a6e  cyan-0
w #b2f4ff  cyan-3 glint
ramp steel 1 2 3 4 5 6
ramp cyan c C b w
